Exponential-Weibull (NME-Weibull) distribution of Alshanbari et al.
(2023). The CDF is
\deqn{F(x) = 1 - \frac{\alpha^2 e^{-\lambda x^\beta}}{(\alpha + 1 -
  e^{-\lambda x^\beta})^2}, \quad x \ge 0,}
with \eqn{\alpha, \beta, \lambda > 0}.
